  "answer": "**Node.js 22.0.0 GitHub release and related pages**\n\n1. **Release tag page (primary)** — 2024-04-24, Version 22.0.0 (Current), by @RafaelGSS and @marco-ippolito. Highlights: `require()` of ESM graphs, WebSocket client, V8 updates.  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/node/releases/tag/v22.0.0\n\n2. **Official blog post source on GitHub** — Same announcement in `nodejs/nodejs.org` (`v22.0.0.md`), with installers, binaries, docs, and SHASUMS.  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/nodejs.org/blob/main/apps/site/pages/en/blog/release/v22.0.0.md\n\n3. **v22 changelog** — `CHANGELOG_V22.md` in the Node.js repo.  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/main/doc/changelogs/CHANGELOG_V22.md\n\n4. **All Node.js releases** — Index of GitHub releases for `nodejs/node`.  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/node/releases\n\n5. **Tags list** — Git tags for the Node.js repository (includes later 22.x tags as well).  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/node/tags\n\n6. **Node.js repository** — Main repo; release types and download notes.  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/node\n\n7. **Compare view** — Diff page involving `v22.0.0` (example base shown: `v20.19.2...v22.0.0`).  \n   https://github.com/nodejs/node/compare/v20.19.2...v22.0.0\n\n8. **Unrelated “v22.0.0”** — Actionhero v22.0.0, not Node.js.  \n   https://github.com/actionhero/actionhero/releases/tag/v22.0.0\n\n**Notable points from the 22.0.0 notes:** drop of import assertions; watch mode marked stable; V8 updated to 12.4.254.14 (semver-major); WebSocket enabled by default; default stream `highWaterMark` bumped. At release it was Current, with LTS planned for October 2024.",
